*> PLB-C067 divisor-not-checked: divisions by items that may be zero.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. AVERAGE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-TOTAL            PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
01  WS-COUNT            PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01  WS-AVERAGE          PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
01  WS-MONTHS           PIC 99 VALUE 0.
01  WS-PER-MONTH        PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
01  WS-HUNDRED          PIC 999 VALUE 100.
01  WS-SHARE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LINE.
    ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT
    ADD 12.50 TO WS-TOTAL
    PERFORM REPORT-AVERAGE
    IF WS-COUNT > 0
        PERFORM REPORT-SHARE
    END-IF
    PERFORM SPREAD-TOTAL
    PERFORM SAFE-DIVISIONS
    STOP RUN.
*> Reported: nothing here or in the caller tests WS-COUNT.
REPORT-AVERAGE.
    DIVIDE WS-TOTAL BY WS-COUNT GIVING WS-AVERAGE
    COMPUTE WS-SHARE = WS-AVERAGE / WS-COUNT
    DISPLAY WS-AVERAGE WS-SHARE.
*> Not reported: the caller tests WS-COUNT around the PERFORM.
REPORT-SHARE.
    DIVIDE WS-COUNT INTO WS-TOTAL GIVING WS-AVERAGE.
*> Not reported: WS-MONTHS is given a nonzero literal first.
SPREAD-TOTAL.
    MOVE 12 TO WS-MONTHS
    DIVIDE WS-TOTAL BY WS-MONTHS GIVING WS-PER-MONTH.
*> Not reported: a constant divisor, ON SIZE ERROR, and a test first.
SAFE-DIVISIONS.
    COMPUTE WS-SHARE = WS-TOTAL / WS-HUNDRED
    DIVIDE WS-TOTAL BY WS-COUNT GIVING WS-AVERAGE
        ON SIZE ERROR MOVE 0 TO WS-AVERAGE
    END-DIVIDE
    IF WS-COUNT NOT = 0
        DIVIDE WS-TOTAL BY WS-COUNT GIVING WS-AVERAGE
    END-IF.
